@startuml classes-seguranca-observabilidade
!include ../../../../docs/diagramas/tema-catalogo.iuml
title $I_SEGURANCA Pacotes security e observability: contexto do chamador, telemetria e spans do ciclo de vida

hide empty members
hide <<saida>> stereotype
hide <<serviço>> stereotype
hide <<infra>> stereotype
hide <<exceção>> stereotype
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 40

package "<$lock,scale=0.55,color=#455A64> security" as security <<infra>> {
  class CallerContext <<@RequestScoped>> {
    -token : JsonWebToken
    -config : CatalogConfig.Security
    --
    actor() : Actor
    {static} capabilities(roles) : Set<Capability>
  }
  class Roles <<final>> {
    {static} SELLER = "seller"
    {static} CATALOG_ADMIN = "catalog-admin"
    {static} CATALOG_MODERATOR = "catalog-moderator"
    {static} CATALOG_RESERVATIONS = "catalog-reservations"
  }
  class CapabilityAugmentor <<@ApplicationScoped>> {
    augment(identity, context) : Uni<SecurityIdentity>
  }
  class Capabilities <<final>> {
    {static} MANAGE_OWN_PRODUCTS ... MANAGE_MODERATION_REASONS : String
  }
  class SecurityConfigCheck <<@Startup, @Singleton>> {
    SecurityConfigCheck(issuer, keyLocation, inlineKey, audiences)
  }
  class TenantNotAuthorizedException <<exceção>>
}

package "<$chart_line,scale=0.55,color=#455A64> observability" as observability <<infra>> {
  annotation Traced <<@InterceptorBinding>> {
    entry : boolean = false <<@Nonbinding>>
  }
  class TracedInterceptor <<@Traced, @Interceptor, @Priority(LIBRARY_BEFORE)>> {
    @Inject lifecycle : Lifecycle
    --
    <<@AroundInvoke>> trace(context) : Object
  }
  class Lifecycle <<@ApplicationScoped>> {
    -tracer : Tracer
    --
    step(name, work) : Uni<T>
    job(work) : Uni<T>
    entry(name, attributes, work) : Uni<T>
    nested(name, attributes, work) : Uni<T>
    nested(owner, function, work) : Uni<T>
    sharing(name, attributes, work) : Uni<T>
    linked(name, parent, attributes, work) : Uni<T>
    {static} operation() : Span
    {static} code(owner, function) : Attributes
    {static} refusal(failure) : boolean
  }
  class Telemetry <<final>> {
    {static} TENANT, STORE, USER, ROLES, CORRELATION : String
    {static} PROBLEM_TYPE, PROBLEM_REASONS : String
    --
    {static} tag(key, value)
    {static} problem(status, type, reasons)
    {static} domainEvent(eventType, aggregateId, topic, eventId)
  }
  class RequestTelemetry {
    -token : JsonWebToken
    -security : CatalogConfig.Security
    --
    <<@ServerRequestFilter>> enrich(request, resource)
    <<@ServerResponseFilter>> log(request, response)
  }
  class InventoryLatency <<@ApplicationScoped>> {
    {static} NAME = "catalog.inventory.update.latency"
    {static} SLO_THRESHOLD = 500 ms
    -registry : MeterRegistry
    --
    timed(operation, work) : Uni<T>
  }
  interface Refusal
  class Correlation <<final>> {
    {static} HEADER = "X-Correlation-Id"
    --
    {static} accept(candidate) : String
    {static} bind(correlationId)
    {static} current() : String
  }
  interface SkuCountsSource <<porta>> {
    skuCounts() : Uni<SkuCounts>
  }
  class "SkuCountsSource.SkuCounts" as SkuCounts <<record>> {
    active : long
    sellable : long
  }
  class SkuGauges <<@ApplicationScoped>> {
    -metrics : SkuCountsSource
    -lifecycle : Lifecycle
    -active, sellable : AtomicLong
    --
    <<@Scheduled sku-gauges, SKIP>> refresh() : Uni<Void>
  }
  class SqlClientMetricsFilter {
    {static} isPerConnectionSqlGauge(id) : boolean
    <<@Produces @Singleton>> denyPerConnectionSqlGauges() : MeterFilter
  }
  class RedisClientMetricsFilter {
    {static} isPerConnectionRedisGauge(id) : boolean
    <<@Produces @Singleton>> denyPerConnectionRedisGauges() : MeterFilter
  }
}

class RuntimeException <<infra>> #line.dashed
class "application.Actor" as Actor <<record>> <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "application.Capability" as Capability <<enum>> <<serviço>> #line.dashed
class "persistence.PgCatalogMetrics" as PgCatalogMetrics <<saida>> #line.dashed
class "imports.InvalidImportFileException" as InvalidImportFileException <<exceção>> #line.dashed
interface "config.CatalogConfig" as CatalogConfig <<@ConfigMapping>> <<infra>> #line.dashed

RuntimeException <|-- TenantNotAuthorizedException
Refusal <|.. TenantNotAuthorizedException
Refusal <|.. InvalidImportFileException
CallerContext ..> Actor : cria
CallerContext ..> Capability : papel vira capacidade
CallerContext ..> Roles
CapabilityAugmentor ..> CallerContext : capabilities(roles)
CapabilityAugmentor ..> Capability : nome vira permissão
Capabilities ..> Capability : um nome por constante
CallerContext ..> TenantNotAuthorizedException
CallerContext --> CatalogConfig : security()
RequestTelemetry --> CatalogConfig : security()
RequestTelemetry ..> Telemetry
RequestTelemetry ..> Correlation : current()

TracedInterceptor --> Lifecycle
TracedInterceptor ..> Traced : interceptor binding
Lifecycle ..> Refusal : refusal
SkuGauges --> SkuCountsSource : skuCounts()
SkuGauges --> Lifecycle : job
SkuCountsSource +-- SkuCounts
SkuCountsSource <|.. PgCatalogMetrics

Traced -[hidden]right- TracedInterceptor
TracedInterceptor -[hidden]right- Lifecycle
Lifecycle -[hidden]right- Telemetry
Telemetry -[hidden]right- RequestTelemetry
InventoryLatency -[hidden]right- SkuGauges
SkuGauges -[hidden]right- SqlClientMetricsFilter
SqlClientMetricsFilter -[hidden]right- RedisClientMetricsFilter
Traced -[hidden]down- InventoryLatency
TracedInterceptor -[hidden]down- SkuGauges
Lifecycle -[hidden]down- SqlClientMetricsFilter
Telemetry -[hidden]down- RedisClientMetricsFilter

note bottom of CallerContext
  Chamador derivado só do token já validado: tenant e loja nunca vêm de cabeçalho
  ou corpo, e os papéis do token viram capacidades de negócio. É o único mapa de papel
  para capacidade: GET /me (api.SessionResource) devolve o resultado ao painel, e o
  CapabilityAugmentor (SecurityIdentityAugmentor) dá as mesmas capacidades à identidade
  como permissões, que o @PermissionsAllowed dos resources confere com os nomes de
  Capabilities; nenhum resource cita papel.
  SecurityConfigCheck falha a inicialização se issuer, chave pública ou audiência faltarem.
end note

note bottom of Lifecycle
  Os spans do ciclo de vida das operações. Usado por TracedInterceptor, pelos agendadores
  (OutboxRelay, MessagingHousekeeping, ProductImportWorker, ReservationSweeper e SkuGauges),
  por ProductImportResource e por PgReservationRepository. refusal não pinta o trace de erro
  nas recusas 4xx: exceções de domínio e de aplicação e as que implementam Refusal, sem que
  observability importe as exceções concretas de outros pacotes.
end note

note bottom of SkuCountsSource
  Porta das contagens de SKU: persistence.PgCatalogMetrics a implementa, de modo que
  a persistência depende da observabilidade, e não o contrário.
end note

note bottom of Correlation
  Correlação guardada no contexto Vert.x da requisição. Gravada por api.CorrelationFilter
  e por SellerVerdictConsumer; lida por RequestTelemetry e por outbox.EventOrigin.
end note

note bottom of SqlClientMetricsFilter
  Os filtros removem os gauges por conexão dos clientes SQL e Redis, que o Micrometer
  descartaria depois do primeiro registro com mesmo nome e tags; timers e counters permanecem.
end note

legend right
  <b>Leitura</b>
  <back:$BORDA_INFRA>    </back> Infraestrutura transversal (segurança e observabilidade)
  <back:$BORDA_ERRO>    </back> Exceção classificada como recusa (implementa Refusal)
  <back:#3949AB>    </back> Porta implementada fora do pacote
  <back:$BORDA_APLICACAO>    </back> Aplicação / <back:$BORDA_SAIDA>    </back> Saída
  Borda tracejada: classe de outro pacote
endlegend
@enduml
